{"title": "Speak with Animals (Condition)", "pageid": 5482, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the condition. For the spell, see <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a>. For Wild Magic feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Wild Magic: Speak with Animals\">Wild Magic: Speak with Animals</a>.  For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (disambiguation)\">Speak with Animals (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Speak with Animals</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Can comprehend and communicate with <a href=\"/wiki/Beasts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Beasts\">beasts</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexc