%2CStackId%2CPETPAL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Speak_with_Animals\">Sources of Speak with Animals</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Animal_Speaking\" title=\"Potion of Animal Speaking\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Animal_Speaking\" title=\"Potion of Animal Speaking\">Potion of Animal Speaking</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Cleric)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Cleric)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals (Cleric)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Cleric)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Cleric)\">Speak with Animals (Cleric)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Wild Magic: Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic: Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Wild Magic: Speak with Animals\">Wild Magic: Speak with Animals</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>PETPAL</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hoots'_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\">Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You're pretty sure you could speak to animals if you tried.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Speak_with_Animals\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Condition)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Speak with Animals</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Can comprehend and communicate with <a href=\"/wiki/Beasts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Beasts\">beasts</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200317\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal